\par\par \b \uc2 Citigroup\uc2  Details How Trader Set Off Turmoil\b0\par\par\uc2 By David Benoit \par \uc2 299 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 June 2022\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B5\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 A \uc2 Citigroup Inc\uc2 . trader who sent European stock indexes into free fall last month was working from home and went through several alerts before his order went live, people familiar with the matter said.\par \par \uc2 The bank was able to quickly cancel some trades, but is facing about $50 million in losses, one of the people said.\par \par \uc2 On May 2, the trader in London, working at home on a bank holiday, entered a wrong figure while trying to place an order for a client, the people said.\par \par \uc2 Chaos ensued. Trading was halted momentarily in several markets after major stock indexes plunged for a few minutes in Europe.\par \par \uc2 "One of our traders made an error when inputting a transaction," \uc2 Citigroup\uc2  said last month. "Within minutes, we identified the error and corrected it."\par \par \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  reported earlier on the expected size of the bank's loss.\par \par \uc2 The loss from reimbursing clients wouldn't be material to the bank. \uc2 Citi\uc2 's equity-trading operation brought in $1.5 billion in revenue in the first quarter.\par \par \uc2 But the mistake comes at a delicate time. \uc2 Citigroup\uc2  is under a regulatory order to improve the technology and risk-management systems that protect the bank and customers, a multibillion-dollar project that is demanding the time and effort of senior managers.\par \par \uc2 Several top executives in \uc2 Citigroup\uc2 's markets division have left this year, including its co-head Carey Lathrop and a onetime co-head of equities, Dan Keegan.\par \par \uc2 The fact the trader was at home could also inflame debate across Wall Street about the future of work. \uc2 Citigroup\uc2  has taken a more progressive tack about remote work than other banks.\par \par \uc2 Citigroup\uc2  doesn't think working from home led to the trading mistake, a person familiar with the matter said.\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020220606ei6600009\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
